{"vid":"hs49CPOn68w","source":"hs49CPOn68w.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.3,"txt":"Then."},{"t":4,"txt":"The interviewer will ask, do you"},{"t":5.3,"txt":"have any questions for me?"},{"t":6.7,"txt":"And a lot of times people will go,"},{"t":8,"txt":"nope."},{"t":8.8,"txt":"And, I think that is"},{"t":10.7,"txt":"a recipe for, disaster."},{"t":13,"txt":"So what is your advice when someone"},{"t":15.1,"txt":"says, hey, what are your questions"},{"t":16.4,"txt":"for me?"},{"t":17.6,"txt":"Absolutely."},{"t":18.7,"txt":"As we talked about in advance,"},{"t":20.9,"txt":"the planning that we do, we research"},{"t":22.6,"txt":"the company, we create our themes,"},{"t":24.4,"txt":"we stockpile or create examples"},{"t":26.3,"txt":"that support our themes."},{"t":27.6,"txt":"You should also be thinking about"},{"t":28.9,"txt":"what do you want to know about this"},{"t":30.9,"txt":"job and the questions you"},{"t":32.9,"txt":"ask when an interviewer"},{"t":34.7,"txt":"says, do you have any questions for"},{"t":36.2,"txt":"me? Demonstrate so"},{"t":38.1,"txt":"much about yourself."},{"t":39.4,"txt":"This is actually part of the"},{"t":41.3,"txt":"interview."},{"t":42.6,"txt":"The quality of the question you ask"},{"t":45,"txt":"shows what you've learned about the"},{"t":46.9,"txt":"company and what type of person"},{"t":49,"txt":"you are."},{"t":49.9,"txt":"So have some questions at the"},{"t":51.8,"txt":"ready. I think it's very hollow and"},{"t":53.4,"txt":"empty when you say no, no questions."},{"t":55.7,"txt":"I think it's very important to have"},{"t":57.1,"txt":"some. I personally have a"},{"t":59,"txt":"favourite question that I like to"},{"t":60.7,"txt":"ask. And Andrew, I'd"},{"t":62.6,"txt":"like to role play this if it's okay,"},{"t":64.3,"txt":"because it's hard for me to do both"},{"t":65.6,"txt":"parts of this. So imagine Andrew"},{"t":67.7,"txt":"and I are still doing that interview"},{"t":69.2,"txt":"to see if I should be the lecturer"},{"t":71,"txt":"at Stanford, where I am, and"},{"t":73,"txt":"the interview is over."},{"t":73.8,"txt":"Andrew, and would you ask me if I"},{"t":75.6,"txt":"have any questions for you?"},{"t":77.4,"txt":"Of course. Matt, do you have any"},{"t":78.8,"txt":"questions for me about working here?"},{"t":81.2,"txt":"Andrew, thank you for the interview."},{"t":83.1,"txt":"A big question I have is what"},{"t":85,"txt":"question do you wish you would"},{"t":86.9,"txt":"have asked when you were being"},{"t":88.7,"txt":"hired in for your job?"},{"t":90.8,"txt":"I love this question"},{"t":92.9,"txt":"because it brings out so much"},{"t":94.7,"txt":"insight, and it shows that you're"},{"t":96.4,"txt":"somebody who's really curious about"},{"t":98,"txt":"how the company really works."},{"t":99.8,"txt":"And I have learned so many"},{"t":101.6,"txt":"interesting things from this."},{"t":103,"txt":"Sometimes it's very practical."},{"t":104.8,"txt":"Somebody says, well, I really wish"},{"t":106,"txt":"when I got hired I would have signed"},{"t":107.3,"txt":"up for this particular insurance"},{"t":108.8,"txt":"coverage, but other times it's like"},{"t":111,"txt":"people will give me insights into"},{"t":112.3,"txt":"the inner workings of the company."},{"t":114.2,"txt":"They'll say, well, I really wish I"},{"t":115.6,"txt":"would have known how the difference"},{"t":117.2,"txt":"between the product team"},{"t":119,"txt":"and the engineering team has had"},{"t":120.6,"txt":"some issues."},{"t":121.7,"txt":"And then I follow up, I'll say, oh,"},{"t":123.6,"txt":"so in this role, how would I be able"},{"t":125.5,"txt":"to help with that?"},{"t":126.5,"txt":"So asking a question that gets"},{"t":128.5,"txt":"your interviewer to share insight"},{"t":130.7,"txt":"into the company or their"},{"t":132,"txt":"perspective can be really"},{"t":133.9,"txt":"helpful for you."},{"t":134.8,"txt":"And by the way, this is a little"},{"t":136.3,"txt":"trick and small talk."},{"t":137.8,"txt":"A lot of us are uncomfortable making"},{"t":139.6,"txt":"small talk chit chat."},{"t":141.2,"txt":"If you get the other person talking"},{"t":143,"txt":"about themselves or their experience"},{"t":145.6,"txt":"one they like doing that and"},{"t":147.5,"txt":"they like you for giving them that"},{"t":149.2,"txt":"opportunity. And two, you can get"},{"t":151,"txt":"some really good insight that you"},{"t":152.4,"txt":"can leap off of."},{"t":153.2,"txt":"So the rule for"},{"t":155,"txt":"for chit chat and small talk"},{"t":157,"txt":"is be interested, not interesting."},{"t":159.4,"txt":"And the rule for ending interviews"},{"t":161.1,"txt":"with a question is get the other"},{"t":162.8,"txt":"person talking."},{"t":163.6,"txt":"Demonstrate your interest."},{"t":165.8,"txt":"Yeah, I really, really like that."},{"t":167.7,"txt":"And actually, I've heard,"},{"t":169.9,"txt":"different people throughout my"},{"t":170.8,"txt":"career suggest that"},{"t":172.7,"txt":"including, you know, what is maybe"},{"t":175.1,"txt":"the one weakness that stands out to"},{"t":176.8,"txt":"you about myself on my resume or"},{"t":178.6,"txt":"something that also gives you"},{"t":179.9,"txt":"information if you don't give that"},{"t":181.2,"txt":"get that job to strengthen"},{"t":183.2,"txt":"your resume or something like that"},{"t":184.9,"txt":"in the future. So there are a lot of"},{"t":186.3,"txt":"really good questions that you can"},{"t":187.6,"txt":"use for figuring"},{"t":189.6,"txt":"out if the company is for you, if"},{"t":191,"txt":"the employer is for you, and also"},{"t":192.4,"txt":"just for future job"},{"t":194.3,"txt":"searching purposes."},{"t":195.3,"txt":"So I really like that question."},{"t":197.3,"txt":"If it's an office based job is sort"},{"t":199.2,"txt":"of how you keep your employees"},{"t":201,"txt":"engaged, do you think that's a fair"},{"t":202.4,"txt":"question?"},{"t":203.7,"txt":"Now to basically say, listen, if I'm"},{"t":205.1,"txt":"going to be home most of the time,"},{"t":207.2,"txt":"how do I become part of this team or"},{"t":208.8,"txt":"what's the onboarding process like?"},{"t":210.8,"txt":"Completely, yeah, I would say"},{"t":212.7,"txt":"asking about the onboarding process,"},{"t":215.2,"txt":"asking, you know, what are what are"},{"t":216.8,"txt":"the last few things you've done"},{"t":218.8,"txt":"to interact with co-workers, maybe"},{"t":220.6,"txt":"outside of a typical"},{"t":222.6,"txt":"meeting and whatnot,"},{"t":224.5,"txt":"and just see you and see what kind"},{"t":226.3,"txt":"of examples they come up with?"},{"t":228.2,"txt":"Yeah. And we have a, comment"},{"t":230.2,"txt":"here from Michael who says, I always"},{"t":231.9,"txt":"ask what the greatest changes"},{"t":234,"txt":"in the last year coming year"},{"t":235.8,"txt":"is for the company."},{"t":236.8,"txt":"So I think that's really,"},{"t":238.4,"txt":"interesting to say, sort of."},{"t":239.7,"txt":"Hey, listen, you know, here is sort"},{"t":241,"txt":"of a open ended question for you"},{"t":243,"txt":"and to see how the employer reacts."},{"t":245.9,"txt":"So let's talk mindset first."},{"t":247.7,"txt":"And because I know a lot of people"},{"t":249.5,"txt":"panic because they don't have a lot"},{"t":250.9,"txt":"of time to ask questions."},{"t":252.6,"txt":"So so when"},{"t":254.5,"txt":"you get ready for an interview, you"},{"t":256.3,"txt":"should categorise your questions"},{"t":258.2,"txt":"basically into four buckets."},{"t":259.9,"txt":"Company specific questions,"},{"t":263.2,"txt":"role specific questions, boss"},{"t":265.1,"txt":"related questions, and then"},{"t":266.4,"txt":"interview or related questions."},{"t":268.1,"txt":"So you want to make sure that you're"},{"t":269.7,"txt":"categorising those so that you can"},{"t":271.7,"txt":"pick and choose the questions that"},{"t":273.2,"txt":"you want to ask based on the"},{"t":274.7,"txt":"interviewer you have."},{"t":276.4,"txt":"And then I want you to think of the"},{"t":277.9,"txt":"interview process as one"},{"t":280.1,"txt":"whole entity."},{"t":281.5,"txt":"And I want you to assume when you"},{"t":283.1,"txt":"start that screen with the recruiter"},{"t":285.1,"txt":"or HR person, I'm going to win"},{"t":287.2,"txt":"this. I'm going to get the job,"},{"t":289,"txt":"which means I have the entire"},{"t":290.6,"txt":"interview process to get all my"},{"t":292.3,"txt":"questions asked."},{"t":293.6,"txt":"The most important thing for you is"},{"t":295.2,"txt":"to be organised in the way that you"},{"t":296.8,"txt":"ask those questions, and organised"},{"t":298.6,"txt":"in your ability to actually know"},{"t":300.7,"txt":"which questions to ask this"},{"t":302.5,"txt":"particular interviewer."},{"t":303.8,"txt":"It's usually pretty easy to do."},{"t":305.7,"txt":"Most of the time you have"},{"t":307.6,"txt":"the interviewers name or at least"},{"t":309.6,"txt":"their function, or maybe both."},{"t":311.7,"txt":"And if you don't, that's something"},{"t":313.6,"txt":"that you should get early on in the"},{"t":315,"txt":"process. And if you've written out"},{"t":316.4,"txt":"your questions or typed them out or"},{"t":317.9,"txt":"however you wanted to do that, when"},{"t":319.8,"txt":"you get into the interview,"},{"t":320.9,"txt":"prioritise the questions."},{"t":322.3,"txt":"And if you are dealing with somebody"},{"t":324.2,"txt":"who can answer a an array"},{"t":326.3,"txt":"of those questions from those"},{"t":327.6,"txt":"different groups I mentioned,"},{"t":329.5,"txt":"you want to go from the top down."},{"t":331.1,"txt":"You want to ask corporate level"},{"t":332.2,"txt":"questions first, then role,"},{"t":334.1,"txt":"then boss, and so on."},{"t":336.7,"txt":"An interviewer I mean, is there"},{"t":338.2,"txt":"something specific to the interview?"},{"t":339.9,"txt":"Don't sweat if they only give you"},{"t":341.7,"txt":"five minutes to ask."},{"t":342.8,"txt":"Ask the ones you can prioritise"},{"t":344.6,"txt":"them before you go in and remember"},{"t":346.9,"txt":"that you will have more time to ask"},{"t":348.7,"txt":"more questions."},{"t":349.8,"txt":"So yes. No, I would definitely"},{"t":352.4,"txt":"I mean, we, we spend a"},{"t":354.3,"txt":"lot of time on this stuff because"},{"t":356.5,"txt":"you can you, you"},{"t":358.6,"txt":"are interviewing them to just"},{"t":360.5,"txt":"remember that. Right. So you want to"},{"t":361.8,"txt":"be buttoned up."},{"t":363,"txt":"Yeah. And I think also what I take"},{"t":364.6,"txt":"away is, you know, anyone"},{"t":366.6,"txt":"who's ever interviewed anyone, I"},{"t":368.5,"txt":"think often they, they take more"},{"t":370.3,"txt":"from those questions they get"},{"t":372.3,"txt":"asked than sometimes what the"},{"t":374.1,"txt":"answers are in other parts of the"},{"t":375.7,"txt":"interview."},{"t":377.8,"txt":"Thanks for watching."},{"t":378.9,"txt":"Some great advice there."},{"t":380.4,"txt":"I hope you found it useful and"},{"t":382,"txt":"informative."},{"t":383.2,"txt":"If you're looking for additional"},{"t":384.4,"txt":"guidance on your career journey,"},{"t":386.1,"txt":"click the buttons on the screen to"},{"t":387.7,"txt":"see the next video in the series"},{"t":390,"txt":"or watch the full length episode"},{"t":392.1,"txt":"for more tips."},{"t":393.4,"txt":"Both videos are also listed"},{"t":395.3,"txt":"in the description below."}],"words":[{"t":0.32,"w":"Then."},{"t":4.05,"w":"The"},{"t":4.05,"w":"interviewer"},{"t":4.05,"w":"will"},{"t":4.05,"w":"ask,"},{"t":4.05,"w":"do"},{"t":4.05,"w":"you"},{"t":5.25,"w":"have"},{"t":5.25,"w":"any"},{"t":5.25,"w":"questions"},{"t":5.25,"w":"for"},{"t":5.25,"w":"me?"},{"t":6.66,"w":"And"},{"t":6.66,"w":"a"},{"t":6.66,"w":"lot"},{"t":6.66,"w":"of"},{"t":6.66,"w":"times"},{"t":6.66,"w":"people"},{"t":6.66,"w":"will"},{"t":6.66,"w":"go,"},{"t":8.039,"w":"nope."},{"t":8.82,"w":"And,"},{"t":8.82,"w":"I"},{"t":8.82,"w":"think"},{"t":8.82,"w":"that"},{"t":8.82,"w":"is"},{"t":10.71,"w":"a"},{"t":10.71,"w":"recipe"},{"t":10